Z||000001||theogre||11-25-2001||12:22 AM||||There is no relay in that system.<P>If you mean the "can" that flashes the lights, under the dash. left side of column as I remember. you may need to drop the trim under the column to see/reach it.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">  <FONT COLOR="blue"><I><B>11-Sept-01, The day the world as we knew it ended.</B></I></FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000002||Matthew_Fiero||11-25-2001||12:40 AM||||Well, my problem is that when my headlights are on, the turn signals flash REALLY slow, when they are off, they still flash really slow but not AS slow. <BR>Do i need to replace the can?||||reg||1
Z||000003||Matthew_Fiero||11-25-2001||12:54 PM||||does anyone have  a part number or a picture of this thing?<BR>i looked under the dash, passanger side, does it look like a metal circle? I don't know exactly where to look||||reg||1
